            <ArticleTitle>[A giant perineural root cyst in the sacral part of the spinal vertebrae].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>255-60</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In a 30-year-old female patient the cause of pain in lower extremities lasting for many years was a giant perineural cyst in the sacral part of the vertebral canal. After radical removal the cyst pain disappeared completely.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
